{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10297200","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10297200","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"narration:0:1029720001:0":{"text":"일을 마친 뒤, 우리는 아쉬워하는 아르사와 우르 부족 아이들과 작별 인사를 했다.","source_cn":"工作告一段落，你们告别了依依不舍的阿尔萨与乌尔氏族的孩子们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77BC28D2A7E0309E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:1:1029720002:0":{"text":"우리는 소렌의 호송을 받으며 성석 마을로 돌아갔다...","source_cn":"搭着货车，在索恩的护送下，你们风尘仆仆地回到了圣石镇……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4130D6EA1D43B607","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029720003:1":{"text":"브루투스 님은 여전히 당당하고 강한 기운을 풍기시더라!","source_cn":"布鲁特斯大人还是一样威风凛凛，又充满了强者气度！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF58F06318FCACFF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029720004:1":{"text":"아르사도 잘 했어. 처음에는 약간 긴장한 것 같은데, 점점 더 능숙해지는 것 같더라고.","source_cn":"阿尔萨也表现得很好，尽管一开始有点紧张，但后头就越来越...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2220AEA33AB985F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029720005:1":{"text":"소렌... 소렌은 여전히 말이 없지만 역시 든든해.","source_cn":"索恩……索恩就还是一如既往地不怎么说话，但人还是很稳重。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA7FCE1A1760E48B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029720006:1":{"text":"그러고 보니 이번 사막 여행에 뭔가 빠진 것 같은데...","source_cn":"说起来，我总觉得，这次的沙漠之行，好像少了什么……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x208AEDBA41C9D25D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029720007:1":{"text":"맞아. 분명 도적도 토벌했고, 무역 거점도 세웠고, 마차도 타고. 굉장히 많은 일을 했는데...","source_cn":"对哦，明明又是剿灭盗匪，又是经营贸易站，又是赶车拉货，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C5FA90986741C3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029720008:1":{"text":"브루투스 님 옆에...","source_cn":"布鲁特斯大人身边却——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA99C4247636A5007","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1029720009:0":{"text":"바로 그때, 화물칸에서 카랑카랑한 목소리가 들려왔다?!","source_cn":"正在此时，一个响亮的声音响了起来，方向是——货厢？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7AD0E371E76575B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1029720010:0":{"text":"맞아요. 그건 바로 북적북적한 분위기를 사랑하는 이 칼라가 타이밍을 노려서 더 재미있는 일을 찾아냈기 때문이죠!","source_cn":"没错，那是因为最喜欢热闹的曼卡拉我，已经瞅准了时机，找...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE68361397F982754","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1029720011:1":{"text":"여러분, 잘 지내셨나요! 여러분이 사랑하는 칼라가 성석 마을에 왔어요!","source_cn":"各位，你们好吗！你们最喜欢的曼卡拉，来到圣石镇啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F14CDAEB57B419C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1029720011":{"text":"여러분, 잘 지내셨나요! 여러분이 사랑하는 칼라가 성석 마을에 왔어요!","source_cn":"各位，你们好吗！你们最喜欢的曼卡拉，来到圣石镇啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F14CDAEB57B419C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1029720012:1":{"text":"당연히 화물칸을 타고 왔죠! 물건이 많지 않아서 상자를 조금 옮기니까 자리가 생기더라고요!","source_cn":"当然是马车的车厢里，你们现在的货物运送量不多，我把箱子...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDC24063EDDB2941","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1029720014:1":{"text":"이분이 바로 미스릴 상회의 로완 도련님이시군요? 아센 사막을 위해 힘써주셔서 다시 한 번 감사드려요!","source_cn":"那么，这位就是秘银商会的罗万少爷了吧！再次感谢您为荒角...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBEB6F8030128871","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1029720015:0":{"text":"뭘요. 서로 좋자고 한 일인 걸요.","source_cn":"啊，不用客气，这是合作共赢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA424B2D4D4504BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1029720016:0":{"text":"그러면 전 소문으로만 듣던 부자 동네인 성석 마을부터 구경해 볼게요!","source_cn":"那么，我就先去传说中富饶的圣石镇游玩啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF448EE2E1D0AC346","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1029720017:0":{"text":"용감한 칼라는 세상을 즐겨야 하니까요. 여러분, 나중에 또 만나요!","source_cn":"正所谓，勇敢的曼卡拉先享受世界！朋友们，再会！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x729129AE73FBB316","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1029720018:0":{"text":"칼라는 모두에게 열정적으로 인사를 남긴 뒤 폭풍처럼 사라졌다...","source_cn":"就像在擂台上一样，曼卡拉热情洋溢地问候了所有人后，犹如...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1EBA1A3C72F1A67","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1029720019:1":{"text":"오, 칼라는... 여전히 활기가 넘치네요...","source_cn":"呃唔，曼卡拉小姐，还是这么有活力……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F56ACE775265944","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1029720020:1":{"text":"로완, 깜짝 놀랐죠? 저도 가끔 칼라랑 눈이 마주치면 긴장하거든요.","source_cn":"你不会被吓到了吧，罗万？每次被她盯着看的时候，我也会很紧张。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D0887EE974CDA42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status"